{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"tl-v1","tool":"ragflow_retrieval","arguments":{"dataset_ids":["d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37"],"metadata_condition":{"logic":"and","conditions":[{"name":"path","comparison_operator":"is","value":"sources"}]},"question":"Storage quota monitoring hard-halt check marked done current status later evidence reopened buffer September 22 2026","page_size":10,"vector_similarity_weight":0.3,"similarity_threshold":0.2,"top_k":1024,"keyword":false},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"chunks\": [{\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-SLACK-22\\n\\n# Slack Thread: Storage Quota Management Design\\n\\n**Channel**: #cipherdoc\\n\\n**Date**: 2026-08-04\\n\\n---\\n\\n**[2026-08-04 09:30] Evan**: Starting on storage quota management. We need to keep `cipherdoc` from filling up the disk on these workstations, especially on large batch jobs.\\n\\n**[2026-08-04 09:39] Evan**: Implementing a disk-usage monitor loop. It'll check available space before starting any new redaction job.\\n\\n**[2026-08-04 09:41] Alice**: What's the threshold?\\n\\n**[2026-08-04 10:08] Evan**: Going with a hard 500MB floor for now. If free space drops below that, the engine pauses and alerts the user.\\n\\n**[2026-08-04 10:26] Diana**: We also need a way to clear the cache — the `/tmp` folder doesn't always clean up properly after a crash.\\n\\n**[2026-08-04 10:41] Evan**: I'll add a purge-cache option and run a sweep on startup too.\\n\\n**[2026-08-04 10:44] Evan**: @Bob, can we get a hook in the `FileStreamer` to report current disk usage for the active job?\\n\\n**[2026-08-04 11:30] Bob**: Sure, I'll add a `get_quota_usage()` method to the stream controller.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 22 slack thread storag quota manag design channel cipherdoc date 2026 08 04 2026 08 04 09 30 evan start on storag quota manag we need to keep cipherdoc from fill up the disk on these workstat especi on larg batch job 2026 08 04 09 39 evan implement a disk usag monitor loop it ll check avail space befor start ani new redact job 2026 08 04 09 41 alic what s the threshold 2026 08 04 10 08 evan go with a hard 500mb floor for now if free space drop below that the engin paus and alert the user 2026 08 04 10 26 diana we also need a way to clear the cach the tmp folder doesn t alway clean up proper after a crash 2026 08 04 10 41 evan i ll add a purg cach option and run a sweep on startup too 2026 08 04 10 44 evan bob can we get a hook in the filestream to report current disk usag for the activ job 2026 08 04 11 30 bob sure i ll add a get _ quota _ usag method to the stream control\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e8e0ea928a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-04-storage-quota-monitor.md\", \"id\": \"9a05aa4017f04966\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3120004885272386, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.11071385503891236, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7816693, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-04-storage-quota-monitor.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e8e0ea928a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-04-storage-quota-monitor.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-04-storage-quota-monitor.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1088, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:04:37\", \"token_count\": 344, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"- **2026-09-18**: Bob - Buffer Refactor (Active (Reopened))\\n\\n - *Refactored the disk-usage monitor to allow a 10% buffer above quota, since th