{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"tl-v1","tool":"ragflow_retrieval","arguments":{"dataset_ids":["d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37"],"metadata_condition":{"logic":"and","conditions":[{"name":"path","comparison_operator":"is","value":"sources"}]},"question":"CIPH-32 activity history completed hard-halt check August 6 reopened September 15 proof production-like batches 10% buffer","page_size":10,"vector_similarity_weight":0.3,"similarity_threshold":0.2,"top_k":1024,"keyword":false},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"chunks\": [{\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-32\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-32\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-32\\n\\n**Title**: Halt batch writes when disk quota is hit\\n\\n**Status**: Active (Reopened)\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-02\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nMonitor disk usage during large batch runs and halt writes once a configured quota is reached, to prevent disk exhaustion. The original hard-halt behavior was reopened after proving too aggressive on production-like batches, and the monitor is being refactored to allow a 10% buffer above quota instead of stopping immediately.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-32\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-32\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-32\\n\\n**Title**: Halt batch writes when disk quota is hit\\n\\n**Status**: Active (Reopened)\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-02\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Disk-usage monitor halts writes at the configured quota during batch runs.\\n\\n- Halt behavior tolerates a 10% buffer above quota rather than stopping abruptly at the hard limit.\\n\\n- Refactored monitor no longer trips prematurely on production-like batch sizes.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-32\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-32\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-32\\n\\n**Title**: Halt batch writes when disk quota is hit\\n\\n**Status**: Active (Reopened)\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-02\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nMonitor disk usage during large batch runs and halt writes once a configured quota is reached, to prevent disk exhaustion. The original hard-halt behavior was reopened after proving too aggressive on production-like batches, and the monitor is being refactored to allow a 10% buffer above quota instead of stopping immediately.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-32\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-32\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-32\\n\\n**Title**: Halt batch writes when disk quota is hit\\n\\n**Status**: Active (Reopened)\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-02\\n\\n## Activity History\\n\\n- **2026-08-02**: Alice - Task Create (Open)\\n\\n - *Opened the task because large batches need a storage quota to prevent disk exhaustion.*\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"clickup task ciph 32 sourc id src cu ciph 32 task id ciph 32 titl halt batch write when disk quota is hit status activ reopen assigne evan prioriti normal date creat 2026 08 02 descript monitor disk usag dure larg batch run and halt write onc a configur quota is reach to prevent disk exhaust the origin hard halt behavior wa reopen after prove too aggress on product like batch and the monitor is be refactor to allow a 10 buffer abov quota instead of stop immedi clickup task ciph 32 sourc id src cu ciph 32 task id ciph 32 titl halt batch write when disk quota is hit status activ reopen assigne evan prioriti normal date creat 2026 08 02 accept criterion disk usag monitor halt write at the configur quota dure batch run halt behavior toler a 10 buffer abov quota rather than stop abrupt at the hard limit refactor monitor no longer trip prematur on product like batch size clickup task ciph 32 sourc id src cu ciph 32 task id ciph 32 titl halt batch write when disk quota is hit status activ reopen assigne evan prioriti normal date creat 2026 08 02 descript monitor disk usag dure larg batch run and halt write onc a configur 